<div class="warning">
  <div class="warning-title">⚠️ 辅助功能权限 / Accessibility Permission</div>
  <p><b>安装前</b>请前往 系统设置 → 隐私与安全性 → 辅助功能，选中 RetroWin，点击 <b>−</b> 移除。</p>
  <p><b>安装后</b>重新打开 RetroWin，在辅助功能中重新添加并启用开关。</p>
  <hr style="border:none;border-top:1px solid #FFECB5;margin:8px 0;">
  <p><b>Before installing</b>, go to System Settings → Privacy & Security → Accessibility, select RetroWin, click <b>−</b> to remove it.</p>
  <p><b>After installing</b>, reopen RetroWin and re-add it in Accessibility settings.</p>
